me":"Alqamar Alaswad","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"287"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-24T03:36:18-07:00","id":1391156,"title":"","content":"This book is amazing!!! I love it.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar754_2.gif');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"754\" data-vbnamecard=\"754\">Eldagusto</a> thank you \ud83d\ude0a","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-24T03:52:59-07:00","id":1391157,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Penelope</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1390945-walking-away-from-arcadia-just-released-the-countless-dreams-pdf?p=1391156#post1391156\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This book is amazing!!! I love it.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar754_2.gif');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"754\" data-vbnamecard=\"754\">Eldagusto</a> thank you \ud83d\ude0a</div> </div> </div> </div>This is how I find products, either its created by folks who I enjoy the content of or I hear it recommended by folks with sensibilities comparable to my own. It gives me hope that the Storytellers Vault will actually fill the void of Revised-Pre 5th ed book expansions. Its very much in the style I aspire to with the projects I am working on, specifically the scifi jargon used to revisualize the whole setting.<br /> <br /> Changeling 20 really started a foundation that can very easily be built upon with a the dedicated fandom. Even back when World of Darkness was ending and I was only just getting into Changeling I was surprised at the fandom dedicated to covering material that the canon books never got around to.<br /> <br /> I just love this type of stuff!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-27T02:33:24-07:00","id":1399236,"title":"","content":"I finished the book, really love the ideas in it, and I like the Digital Subspace even more then I remember liking the Digital Web, but I am a fan of reboot and Digimon.<br /> <br /> I need to ask the creator about some stuff, it makes sense with Aetherial Subspace that the Tidal event russelled everyones jimmies, but less sense for the other Subspaces. And in the beginning they talk about Countless seeking refuge from the Surface to escape the Tidal event and also to escape the warring catastrophes of their fellow countless. But later the book seems to just have it it was to escape the Tidal Event.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-27T20:23:13-07:00","id":1399485,"title":"","content":"I feel mildly dissappointed with this as it doesn't seem to engage in UFOLOGY lore or cryptozoology. I am impressed with all it does.. but it doesn't quite fill the niche I was hoping for.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-21T13:34:45-07:00","id":1403879,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lian</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1390945-walking-away-from-arcadia-just-released-the-countless-dreams-pdf?p=1399485#post1399485\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I feel mildly dissappointed with this as it doesn't seem to engage in UFOLOGY lore or cryptozoology. I am impressed with all it does.. but it doesn't quite fill the niche I was hoping for.</div> </div> </div> </div>See for me that\u2019s less a bug but a feature because I was already working on things like Reptilians and greys for my setting and now I don\u2019t have to worry about contradiction. I like it because it covers some interesting sci fi ideas extrapolated from idea by astrophysicists and futurists like a novel take on silicon based life, and void and water life. And it gives me rules for UFO but doesn\u2019t touch on canonizing too much Earth lore. Like for instance the Ancestors are easily a fit for some Cryptids while also tapping into some Hollow Earth options.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-17T13:23:34-07:00","id":1408781,"title":"","content":"I would like it if someone explained it more?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-17T13:36:36-07:00","id":1408783,"title":"","content":"It's basically using Changeling as a basis for an alien invaders game, where the aliens come from various exotic environments and must fuse with humans to survive in ours.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-17T14:25:14-07:00","id":1408788,"title":"","content":"What is their version of the Changling way like? From what I heard it\u2019s disturbing","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-17T21:22:41-07:00","id":1408849,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Konradleijon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1390945-walking-away-from-arcadia-just-released-the-countless-dreams-pdf?p=1408788#post1408788\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What is their version of the Changling way like? From what I heard it\u2019s disturbing</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> So their version of Changeling Way is Alien Abductions. Pretty much new Countless (what the Aliens know themselves as) refugees to Earth have a Caste known as the Chirugeons perform a procedure where they implant their essence into an abducted Human Being. Early hosts had their Chrysalis' artificially triggered by bathing them in Zero Point Energy (Zed is their version of Glamou). This provided instant Countless ready to go, but this drastically reduced their lifespans so they mostly streamlined their process to just tagging pre-chrysalis Countless with trackers while they released them back into the world, they would be warned when their chrysalis is triggered. Their version of Enchantment is also abducted humans, whom they make regular and widespread use of as technicians and crewmembers.<br /> <br /> But it is disturbing in that they pretty much are like the Sidhe and hijack the bodies of Humans without concern for the Mortal's souls. They also aren't aware if they reincarnate after their first lifetime, they might as a side effect, but like the Sidhe they just don't know and they rely off of newly arrived Countless from Subspace. They also seem to only have independent self awareness as a side effect of becoming changelings, their version of Nightmare dice is Harmonic Resonance which represents their previous state of inhuman intelligence as part of collectives. They are also divided into two major groups, the Symbiosis Collective wants to better fit in and steer humanity and the Countless into a position of stability and coohabitation, the other side is the Prophets of Harmony and they want to make sure the Anthropic Radiation (banality) of humanity will not genocide the Countless again and that they can make it possible that humanity is no longer a threat.<br /> <br /> Also secretly some of the Countless arrived on Earth before their version of the Shattering (its called the Tidal event and happened during the moonlanding). The Clade (their version of Kith) Subspecies of Ancestors were the spirits that arouse from species going extinct and they seemed to undergo the changeling way as earthly changelings. Also all fae might actually have origins as the first Countless that went native on Earth.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}